ity_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Open to UMBC students, faculty, and staff. Book time for the Whisper Room or Audio/Video Recording Room.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"umbc-aok-retriever-learning-center","subject_type":"study_space","entity_name":"Retriever Learning Center (RLC)","title":"Retriever Learning Center (RLC)","subtitle":"Albin O. Kuhn Library & Gallery","notes":"Arrange the mobile furniture around your group’s task, then use the movable whiteboards and large monitors to work through problems, drafts, or slides together.","short_summary":"A flexible collaboration space with mobile furniture, whiteboards, and monitors.","evidence_claim":"The RLC provides mobile furniture, movable whiteboards, large monitors, computers, and individual and group study space; the library designates it as a 24-hour space.","source_url":"https://library.umbc.edu/studyspaces.php","source_title":"Study Spaces, Lockers & Specialty Rooms | Albin O. Kuhn Library & Gallery","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"The library lists the RLC as a 24-hour space; check the library’s current hours page for exceptions.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"umbc-aok-library-floors-3-and-4","subject_type":"study_space","entity_name":"AOK Library Floors 3 and 4","title":"AOK Library Floors 3 and 4","subtitle":"Albin O. Kuhn Library & Gallery","notes":"Choose these whisper-level floors when reading or drafting needs fewer interruptions; library PCs are available if you need to switch from laptop work.","short_summary":"Quiet library floors with computers for individual study.","evidence_claim":"The library designates its third and fourth floors as quiet areas where users should keep volume to a whisper, and reports 22 